## License reconciliation

The upstream tree was internally inconsistent: its `LICENSE` file contained the
GNU GPL version 3 text, its `package.json` declared `GPL-3.0-or-later`, and its
`README.md` said "GPL-3.0". The native rewrite has no `package.json` because it
ships no Node.js toolchain, and its `README.md` previously had no license
section.

This fork resolves the ambiguity as **GPL-3.0-or-later**, matching the upstream
package metadata and the "or later" option. `LICENSE` contains the GPLv3 text;
this notice states the "or later" grant and the modification history.

